        {
          "id": 2591403928,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The FID name goes into dcerpc_store_polhnd_name() and that's what WS-WSP is using to determine its dissection., so to me your change was more than cosmetic, but also why I thought it could have been a search/replace bug because when it's added to a column the \"comma + space\" makes sense, but not when creating the FID name for  dcerpc_store_polhnd_name()",
          "author": {
